  "prefLabel": "Home 305.01 License",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Home 305.01 License. An applicant for licensure as a home inspector, who has satisfactorily met all the requirements of RSA 310-A and who has paid all of the fees, shall be issued a license by the board. The licensee shall be issued a license authorizing the practice of home inspection that shall show the full name of the licensee, shall have a serial number, and shall be signed by members of the board.\n\nSource. #9506, eff 7-8-09; ss by #12463, eff 1-23-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/home100-600.html"
